      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom duplex to the market in the highly sought-after Hayworth Terrace, Ongar, Dublin 15.\nIdeally positioned, this property enjoys an excellent location with schools and shops right on your doorstep, while Ongar Village is also within immediate reach and offers a fantastic selection of local amenities including cafés, restaurants and everyday conveniences. The area is exceptionally well connected with excellent transport links, with Hansfield Train Station just approximately 3 minutes away, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\nBright and well-proportioned internal accommodation extending to approximately c. 97 sq.m briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living accommodation, kitchen, three well-appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms. The property further benefits from two private balconies, including a west-facing balcony, providing excellent outdoor space and the opportunity to enjoy afternoon and evening sunshine.\nNo. 47 comes to the market very well maintained throughout and benefits from gas fired central heating, a recently upgraded boiler, recently renovated tiling and a floored attic space with Stira access, providing excellent additional storage.\nWith its excellent location, generous accommodation, two balconies and well-maintained condition, this property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to trade up.\nGuide Price 350,000.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n• C. 97 sq.m\n• 3 Bed / 2 Bath Duplex\n• BER C Rated\n• Two private balconies\n• West-facing balcony\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Recently upgraded boiler\n• Floored attic space with Stira access\n• Very well-maintained throughout\n• Management fees c. 650 per annum\n• Schools and shops on your doorstep\n• Ongar Village on your doorstep\n• Hansfield Train Station c. 3 minutes away\n• Excellent transport links\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and those trading up\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
